Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.90,H_ms,,0,0,0,,Sistem bagi teknologi BATERI. "Esok dia bagi BILLION."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.90,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Cipta benda daripada kosong —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Ini ganjaran daripada sistem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.82,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Apa ada di dalam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.10,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Teknologi lengkap bateri lithium-udara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.94,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Nota sistem tulis begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:06.88,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Anak muda,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.02,S_ms,,0,0,0,,sekarang awak sudah buktikan sistem awak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:08.96,S_ms,,0,0,0,,kemungkinan besar betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.14,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak tahu apa maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:11.08,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.02,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Maksudnya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:12.96,S_ms,,0,0,0,,awak akan naik pangkat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.06,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Seriuslah sikit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.02,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sila, Pak Cik Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.10,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kewujudan sistem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.04,S_ms,,0,0,0,,bermakna awak memiliki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.66,S_ms,,0,0,0,,senjata pengubah nasib.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.34,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Hari ni dia hantar teknologi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.28,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Esok
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.58,S_ms,,0,0,0,,boleh hantar puluhan bilion tunai,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.82,S_ms,,0,0,0,,malah kuasa super.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.30,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Selama awak diam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:27.38,S_ms,,0,0,0,,awak boleh jadi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:28.86,S_ms,,0,0,0,,watak utama dunia ini.
